## What this repo carries

- **Planning process** — OpenSpec (`openspec/`): every change starts as a spec, becomes
  a plan and tasks, and is validated before it is archived.
- **Agent rulebook** — one source in `.ruler/`, fanned out to {{ agents | join(', ') }}.
- **Definition-of-done gate** — work is not "done" until the plan is satisfied and tests
  exist in the right place, of the right type, and pass.
{% if mode == 'greenfield' %}- **Project skeleton** — a {{ architecture }} layout for {{ language_stack }}.{% endif %}

